  "frame": "Roblox's: 1 = one of the shard's units. Each MeshPart is CFrame(location) * rotation * CFrame(centre) from the root; a bud goes on its host piece the same way, welded.",
  "surface": "TextureID reveal_palette.png on every piece and bud; the core takes no texture, its Color by the rule, SmoothPlastic. The ViewportFrame lit flat: Ambient white, LightColor black (to be read in the engine against the palette's swatches)",
